{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17107590","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17107590","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1710759001:1":{"text":"ああ、デューラ様に感謝！コンティオ様もいらしたのですね！","source_cn":"艾雅在上！亲王殿下！您也在这里！真是太好了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3456E0EAF2EE73B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710759002:1":{"text":"こ、ここは一体どこなのですか？私たちは王子殿下の晩餐会にいたはずでは……","source_cn":"这、这到底是何处啊？我只记得王子殿下那场无与伦比的晚宴……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93EC5B023400EE2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710759003:1":{"text":"ええい、喚くな！その頭は飾りか、グランデ男爵？","source_cn":"哼……闭嘴！你的脑子呢，葛朗台男爵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AB360C33C0D9C6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710759004:1":{"text":"この特徴的な彫像とアーチ型の天井を見ても、分からないのか？","source_cn":"你难道看不出这标志性的雕像和拱顶吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D0BB6018D7C5629","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710759005:1":{"text":"え？えっとぉ……","source_cn":"这……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DFC0A906A6F5B3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710759006:1":{"text":"ここは、古聖堂だ。","source_cn":"这里是圣古堂。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FC8F7ECE08A8E0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710759007:1":{"text":"ま、またまた、ご冗談を！","source_cn":"殿下，您……您真会开玩笑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9DA5830DA92B235","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710759008:1":{"text":"だって、こ、古聖堂は……消えたはずでは……？","source_cn":"圣古堂……圣古堂它不是……它不是……消失了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07B03A5819B5F3D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710759009:1":{"text":"ふんっ……だが現に、晩餐会の参加者は全員、その古聖堂にいるのだ。","source_cn":"哼……但我们，所有参加晚宴的人，现在都在这座消失的教堂里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FC0D0C92DA111DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710759010:1":{"text":"そんな！？わ、私たちはここに閉じ込められたのですか！？","source_cn":"艾雅在上！我们、我们被困住了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF11AA2DE86DA11DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710759011:1":{"text":"ああ、コンティオ様！どうか、どうかお助けください！私はまだ――","source_cn":"殿下！亲王殿下！您想想办法啊！我、我不想——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32ED717101418133","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710759012:1":{"text":"我に近づくな、うっとうしい！","source_cn":"滚开吧，葛朗台。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F8FA475C97F90D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710759013:1":{"text":"まったく、エイドリアンはなぜ貴様のような奴を猟に呼んだのだ……","source_cn":"真不知道奥利安为什么会邀请你这种货色参加行猎……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FAE9ED1F80FA4DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:男爵葛朗台":{"text":"男爵のグランデ","source":"男爵葛朗台","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:亲王孔蒂":{"text":"親王のコンティオ","source":"亲王孔蒂","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":2}}